 drivers/md/raid1-10.c |  5 ---
 drivers/md/raid5.c    | 86 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 drivers/md/raid5.h    |  3 ++
 4 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/md/md.h b/drivers/md/md.h
